# Sprint 1 Validation Report

## Login Validation Testing

Test Case 1:
Click Authenticate Access with empty username and password fields.

Expected Result:
The system should reject the login attempt and display an error message.

Actual Result:
Nothing happens when the button is clicked.

Status:
Fail

Recommendation:
Add validation messages for empty fields and prevent login submission until required fields are completed.

Test Case 2:
Entered short password "123".

Expected Result:
Password should be rejected for being under 8 characters.

Actual Result:
No validation response displayed and button does not respond

Status:
Fail

Button does not respond to any entries
